<title>USA: Asia Pacific Wires to trade on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Asia Pacific Wires to trade on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Pacific Wires and Cable Corp Ltd said it would begin trading on the New York Stock Exchange on Wednesday, December 11 under the symbol AWC.</p>
<p>Asia Pacific Wire and Cable manufactures and distributes telecommunications and power cable and enameled wire products in the Asia Pacific region, primarily in Singapore and Thailand.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
